 "schema": "render-shader-layouts/v1",
 "description": "Declared shader layouts (RFC 0016 'Shader artifacts', check render.shader-artifacts). tools/render/shader_artifacts.py checks every artifact's reflection against its pass or family at build time. Passes are the native backend's pipelines today (descriptor sets as the backend numbers them); families are render.material.v2 families on the port (at most four groups, set index = role: frame 0, view 1, material 2, draw 3). Change a declaration only with the shader interface it describes; 'derive-layouts' prints what the reflections imply.",
